/Title (This project provided valuable hands-on experience in SQL and data analysis by extracting meaningful insights from Instagram user data. I successfully created and managed a database using DDL and DML queries in MySQL Workbench, enabling efficient data organization. Through various SQL queries, I analyzed key metrics such as user engagement, inactive users, contest winners, hashtag trends, and bot activity, offering insights that can aid in marketing strategies, product improvements, and investor evaluations. This project enhanced my SQL skills, problem-solving abilities, and data interpretation expertise, reinforcing the significance of data-driven decision-making in real-world business scenarios.)
